hadiths[17]{hadithnumber,text}:
"84","'A'isha said"
"85","Ibn Abi Nu'm said"
"86","Al-Bara' said"
"87","Jubayr ibn Nufayr said"
"88","Anas said"
"89","Anas ibn Malik said"
"90","'A'isha said"
"91","Abu Hurayra said"
"92","Numayr ibn Aws said"
"93","An-Nu'man ibn Bashir said that his father had carried him to the Messenger\nof Allah"
"94","Ibn 'Umar said"
"95","'Someone who does not show mercy will not be shown mercy.'"""""
"96","Jarir ibn 'Abdullah said"
"97","Same as 97."""""
"98","'A'isha said"
"99","Abu 'Uthman reported that 'Umar wanted to appoint a man as governor.\nThe governor said"
"100","Abu Hurayra reported that the Messenger of Allah"
